WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Check the label on a cheap T-shirt.

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.750
Someone, somewhere, cut and sewed it.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.030
Around the world, many people live below
the World Bank's poverty line of about

4
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.780
3 dollars a day.

5
00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:17.160
And war, natural disasters and debt
can trap whole countries in poverty.

6
00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:20.260
So when someone is paid
pennies to make what we buy,

7
00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.920
whose problem is that?

8
00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:26.460
In this mission, you'll separate
absolute poverty from relative poverty.

9
00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:31.210
Then you'll trace the causes, from
illness and lost jobs to unfair trade,

10
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:34.000
that can trap families for generations.

11
00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:37.960
Your mission: work out who should
act when people are exploited.
